    "lawCode": "Amd §§1676 & 1680, Pub Auth L",
    "lawSection": "Public Authorities Law",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S2610\n\n TITLE OF BILL :\nAn act to amend the public authorities law, in relation to authorizing\nthe dormitory authority to construct and finance certain facilities of\nthe YMCA of Greater Syracuse\n\n\n PURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL :\nThis bill would allow the Dormitory Authority to finance construction\nof the YMCA of Greater Syracuse's facilities and those of their\nsatellite branches.\n\n SUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS :\nThis bill would add new undesignated paragraphs to subdivision 2 of\nsection 1676 and subdivision 1 of section 1680 of the public\nauthorities law to allow the Dormitory Authority to finance\nconstruction of the facilities of the YMCA of Greater Syracuse.\n\n JUSTIFICATION :\nThe YMCA of Greater Syracuse and its related branches provide many\nneeded and worthwhile community programs and services.  As part of\nthat, it would be beneficial to expanding these programs if they could\nobtain financing and/or refinancing for their capital projects at the\nlowest possible cost.\n\n PRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY :\nNew bill.\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :\nNone.\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE :\nImmediately.\n",
